From [[Cradle to Cradle]]. The partner to a [[Biological Nutrient]].

Metals, plastics, and other made materials that can't safely go back to the soil. They are meant to stay in use, going around inside industry.

The ways to keep one going, best first: reuse it, repair it, rebuild it, and last of all recycle it.

None of that works unless the thing can be taken apart. See [[Design for Disassembly]], [[Monstrous Hybrid]].
